1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,562
October 11, 2026. In a village near Gingee, a seven-year-old girl celebrates her birthday.

2
00:00:06,612 --> 00:00:09,307
That night she falls asleep beside her mother.

3
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:16,480
At 3 am, a neighbour hears a child crying "Amma, Amma" three times.

4
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:19,288
In the morning, the girl is no longer in the house.

5
00:00:19,338 --> 00:00:22,407
To this day she has not been found. This is an unsolved case.

6
00:00:22,457 --> 00:00:25,027
But these are the facts known so far.

7
00:00:25,077 --> 00:00:26,149
Watch till the end.

8
00:00:39,649 --> 00:00:43,068
This is a case that is still unsolved and under investigation.

9
00:00:43,118 --> 00:00:45,503
No one has been declared guilty in it.

10
00:00:45,553 --> 00:00:48,363
It is not our intention to blame anyone.

11
00:00:48,413 --> 00:00:51,710
We tell it based only on press reports.

12
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,570
Where reports differ, we say so.

13
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:59,500
All pictures are illustrations. If new information comes, we will tell it in the next part.

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,819
This story takes place in Alampoondi village near Gingee in Villupuram district.

15
00:01:05,869 --> 00:01:09,772
Some reports name the nearby Nadupattu village instead.

16
00:01:09,822 --> 00:01:13,232
The girl's name is Hemalatha. Some reports call her Hemavathi.

17
00:01:13,282 --> 00:01:16,445
She is seven years old and studies in Class 2 at a government school.

18
00:01:16,495 --> 00:01:18,978
Her parents are daily-wage workers.

19
00:01:19,028 --> 00:01:23,920
Reports say it is a family connected with farm labour and brick-kiln work.

20
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:27,503
October 11. Her seventh birthday. Relatives came.

21
00:01:27,553 --> 00:01:30,283
They cut a cake. An ordinary, happy day.

22
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:33,805
That night everyone went to sleep as usual.

23
00:01:33,855 --> 00:01:37,450
In the house where her parents and grandmother slept, Hemalatha slept too.

24
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:43,020
October 12, around 3 am. When the parents woke up, the child was not there.

25
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:45,675
First they searched around the house and in the street.

26
00:01:45,725 --> 00:01:50,227
There was no answer. The same day, they filed a complaint at the Sathyamangalam police station.

27
00:01:50,277 --> 00:01:51,933
Here is an important point.

28
00:01:51,983 --> 00:02:00,088
One neighbour has said that at 3 am he heard a child crying out for her mother three times.

29
00:02:00,138 --> 00:02:00,973
Another piece of information.

30
00:02:01,023 --> 00:02:13,237
One report says a 75-year-old woman who lives alone in a field about 200 metres from the house said someone knocked on her door twice at 3 am.

31
00:02:13,287 --> 00:02:18,358
But reports say the family says they heard nothing.

32
00:02:18,408 --> 00:02:22,340
Investigators are looking into this difference.

33
00:02:22,390 --> 00:02:24,679
Here is a truth we must know.

34
00:02:24,729 --> 00:02:31,696
Police officers always say the first few hours matter greatly when searching for a missing child.

35
00:02:31,746 --> 00:02:35,299
If a clue turns up within that time, the chance of finding the child is higher.

36
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:39,447
Sathyamangalam police registered a case and began the search.

37
00:02:39,497 --> 00:02:44,175
According to news reports, more than a hundred policemen joined the search.

38
00:02:44,225 --> 00:02:48,479
Drone cameras, sniffer dogs and forensic experts all came.

39
00:02:48,529 --> 00:02:53,692
They searched wells, ponds, water bodies, farmland and forest areas.

40
00:02:53,742 --> 00:02:59,451
But no solid clue turned up. Then the police focused on some suspects.

41
00:02:59,501 --> 00:03:03,209
When they looked at their mobile phone traces, one name came up.

42
00:03:03,259 --> 00:03:05,391
It was an astrologer from Thanjavur.

43
00:03:05,441 --> 00:03:12,180
Reports say he had stayed in that village, near the girl's house, for about two weeks.

44
00:03:12,230 --> 00:03:19,393
When the police phoned him to call him in for questioning, reports say he suddenly stopped talking and switched off his phone.

45
00:03:19,443 --> 00:03:22,848
Here is a warning. This is only a piece of investigation information.

46
00:03:22,898 --> 00:03:28,849
No one has declared him guilty. No evidence has come out so far that he is behind this disappearance.

47
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:36,765
Here is the question we ask now. How does a child vanish from a house while her parents are asleep?

48
00:03:36,815 --> 00:03:41,379
One possibility is that someone came from outside and took her.

49
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:44,908
Another possibility is that the child went out by herself.

50
00:03:44,958 --> 00:03:51,288
But where would a seven-year-old go, in the middle of the night, alone, calling for her mother?

51
00:03:51,338 --> 00:03:55,224
Third, it could be the work of someone who knows everything.

52
00:03:55,274 --> 00:03:58,413
The police are looking at all these possibilities.

53
00:03:58,463 --> 00:04:01,400
What do you think? Tell us in the comments.

54
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:04,803
But ten days passed. The search found nothing.

55
00:04:04,853 --> 00:04:06,587
People began to get angry.

56
00:04:06,637 --> 00:04:13,354
Accusing the police of being lax, many political parties and villagers started protests.

57
00:04:13,404 --> 00:04:16,000
The opposition DMK staged a road blockade.

58
00:04:16,050 --> 00:04:20,614
Other parties, including the PMK, also said the child must be found quickly.

59
00:04:20,664 --> 00:04:22,275
That pressure grew big.

60
00:04:22,325 --> 00:04:28,919
Similarly, in Karnataka's Cyanide Mohan case, it was a protest that made the police investigate seriously.

61
00:04:28,969 --> 00:04:30,150
But this case is different.

62
00:04:30,650 --> 00:04:31,344
October 22.

63
00:04:31,394 --> 00:04:38,852
The Tamil Nadu DGP took this case from the local police and transferred it to the Crime Branch CID, the CB-CID.

64
00:04:38,902 --> 00:04:44,312
The CB-CID is the special wing of the Tamil Nadu police that investigates complicated cases.

65
00:04:44,362 --> 00:04:47,601
Cases left unsolved locally mostly come here.

66
00:04:47,651 --> 00:04:50,269
October 23. The CB-CID team's second day.

67
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:53,992
They drew a map of the area around the girl's house.

68
00:04:54,042 --> 00:04:56,660
They questioned the parents and relatives.

69
00:04:56,710 --> 00:04:59,328
So far no one has been arrested in this case.

70
00:04:59,378 --> 00:05:01,500
No one has been declared guilty.

71
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:05,841
Let us see briefly what is known so far.

72
00:05:05,891 --> 00:05:08,969
Hemalatha, seven years old. October 11, her birthday.

73
00:05:09,019 --> 00:05:14,768
She went missing in the early hours of October 12. For the first ten days the local police searched.

74
00:05:14,818 --> 00:05:18,584
More than a hundred police, drones, sniffer dogs.

75
00:05:18,634 --> 00:05:22,704
No result. October 22. The case went to the CB-CID.

76
00:05:22,754 --> 00:05:26,519
The child has still not been found. No one has been arrested yet.

77
00:05:26,569 --> 00:05:34,150
In the next part, we will see what the CB-CID is doing and which clues they have picked up.

78
00:05:34,650 --> 00:05:37,757
This case reminds us of a few things.

79
00:05:37,807 --> 00:05:41,044
One. Protecting children is everyone's responsibility.

80
00:05:41,094 --> 00:05:47,231
If someone new has stayed for a long time in your area, there is nothing wrong in finding out about them.

81
00:05:47,281 --> 00:05:51,226
Two. If a child goes missing, tell the police immediately.

82
00:05:51,276 --> 00:05:56,253
Do not wait. Three. Do not spread rumours about anyone in this case.

83
00:05:56,303 --> 00:05:59,668
Believe only the information that is officially given.

84
00:05:59,718 --> 00:06:03,664
Everyone's prayer is that Hemalatha comes home safe.

85
00:06:03,714 --> 00:06:09,980
Write your opinion in the comments. If you liked this video, like it and subscribe to the channel.

86
00:06:10,030 --> 00:06:12,300
See you in the next part. Thank you.

